  To decrypt the information, you will need the following password. Please store it securely, 
  as it is essential for accessing the content.
</p>

<p class="mt-4 mb-2">
  <b>Decryption password:</b>
</p>

<div class="mb-6 mt-6" style="width: 100%; height: 60px; border: 2px solid red"></div>

<p class="mb-2">
  Note: All information stored on DecLegacy is also available and encrypted in the email inbox of <%= current_user.email %>. 
